// and hrefs must stay in sync with public/project/index.html (the archive
// listing) and the customPages list in astro.config.mjs.
//
// The count is tied to the grid: the last two only render once the grid runs
// four columns, where six cards would leave two holes in the second row. Keep
// the total at eight — the grid is capped at four columns precisely so no
// width can open a fifth one that the list cannot fill.
